  lines:
  - CURRENT RANK... Depends on your average score, increases automatically and unlocks
    upgrades.
  - WEBSITES NUMBER... Purchase to unlock new ladies.
  - MOVEMENT SPEED... Purchase to move between sites faster and easier.
  - MULTI SALE MAX... Purchase to collect. Use ENTER to catch everything!
  - BAN... Purchase to use DOWN ARROW to ban webcams on approach.
  - ENLARGE... Purchase to survive when you master everything else.
